--- !u!114 &1709852090
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1709852081}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40fe67fde4a4351409089804b4848b92, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _documentationText: "MultiSourceToMatHelper Example\r\nSwitches between multiple
    input sources (webcam, video file, image file, or GPU readback) and processes
    each frame as an OpenCV Mat.\r\n\r\nDemonstrates:\r\n- Reading input frames via
    MultiSourceToMatHelper (webcam, video file, image file, or GPU readback)\r\n-
    Configuring MultiSourceToMatHelper per-kind settings via the helper Inspector
    and SourceToMatControlPanel\r\n- Runtime kind switching via the control panel
    MultiSection\r\n- Receiving frames via OnFrameMatUpdated (Inspector wiring)\r\n-
    Calling Play in OnInitialized only when not already playing or paused (!IsPlaying
    &amp;&amp; !IsPaused)\r\n- Recreating the preview texture on OnFrameMatLayoutChanged\r\n-
    Registering a derived frame via DerivedFrameSettings and\r\n  updating its preview
    in the same OnFrameMatUpdated handler\r\n- Hiding DerivedPreview when the derived
    frame is not registered\r\n- Overlaying frame info with putText and measuring
    Mat update rate with FPSCounter\r\n- Displaying output via Texture2D or RenderTexture\r\n\r\nOpenCV
    classes and APIs used:\r\n- Mat, Scalar, Point\r\n- Imgproc: putText\r\n- MultiSourceToMatHelper,
    MultiSourceHelperKind, SourceToMatColorFormat\r\n- OpenCVMatUnityUtils: MatToTexture2D,
    MatToRenderTexture\r\n\r\nUnity integration:\r\n- The Mat returned by FrameMat
    is owned by the active helper; do not dispose it\r\n- RGBA matches Unity RGBA32
    for display\r\n- WebGPU forces AsyncGPU inside WebCamTextureToMatHelper; this
    example does not switch helper types with #if\r\n- Reuse output textures across
    helper switches to avoid preview flicker\r\n- Helper lifecycle events (OnInitialized,
    OnFrameMatUpdated, etc.) are wired in the Inspector on MultiSourceToMatHelper\r\n-
    SourceToMatControlPanel on the same GameObject provides Transport / Transform
    / Kind / capability UI"
  AlignmentSetting: 0
